      "end_seconds": 281.67,
      "duration_seconds": 23.41,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a possible bleed around the brain do well once it's treated properly. An urgent CT scan of the head is what I'd like next, for thunderclap headache this needs an emergency scan, an ambulance is on its way i'll also refer you to the emergency team"
